    "text": "Gallery: Scores Dead, Hundreds Missing in Hong Kong Inferno\nNov. 27, 2025\nA resident surnamed Wang, 71, cries out as his wife remains trapped in the blaze on Wednesday. Photo: IC Photo\nFirefighters continue to tackle the blaze at the Wang Fuk Court housing estate in Tai Po district on Thursday morning. Photo: IC Photo\nFirefighters tackle the blaze with ladders and hoses Wednesday. Photo: VCG\nFlames engulf a high-rise block at Wang Fuk Court. Photo: VCG\nAs of 6 a.m. Thursday, the fire had killed 44 people and injured 58 others. Rescue efforts are ongoing. Photo: VCG\nThick black smoke billows from multiple high-rise buildings as the inferno rages on Wednesday. Photo: VCG\nNext Gallery",
